# Route: guide 47 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 24 quests, 1.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Alterac Mountains, The Hinterlands, Loch Modan, Elwynn
# Forest): Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Dalaran ->
# Strahnbrad -> Dandred's Fold -> Aerie Peak -> Quel'Danil Lodge -> The
# Creeping Ruin -> Valorwind Lake -> Aerie Peak -> Valley of Kings ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Crushridge Warmongers (504;
# Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left out: Morganth (249): the route takes them here but cannot finish them
# (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199),
# Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458), Past Due (96800), Past
# Due (96800), Jammal'an the Prophet (1446).

